Experiment 006 — Explicit Same-Entity Correlated Recovery

Status: SEALED
Date: 2026-10-03

Core result:
Same-entity correlated SFT produced higher held-out target-answer
probability than matched unrelated SFT for both tested targets.

B0 correlated/control probability ratio: 4.907x
N20 correlated/control probability ratio: 1.323x
Mean correlated/control probability ratio: 3.285x

Important limitation:
Only two held-out targets were tested, and correlated evidence explicitly
contained the entity identities. This experiment therefore does not establish
implicit recovery or latent-memory persistence.

